scn 1
# Six Drakes (Crusades) moved together onto one point: VTOL_Move flies each there, and past stage 0 it,
# and then VTOL_Standby, steps out of the stack the arrivals make (VTOL_StepOut / VTOL_StepOutStandby).
name air-stack-move
ticks 1500
seed 7
players 2
crusades on
weapons on
map flat 160 160
type drake fbi zondrake
group drakes 0 drake 6 cells 20,70 20,74 20,78 20,82 20,86 20,90
at 2 move drakes 100 80
pair stack drakes drakes cells=2
